                <pb facs="0765" n="757" sameAs="frus:frus1938v02/pg757"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.9131/93: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-27T10:00:00+03:25">September 27, 1937—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 27—8:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>90. Foreign Office has requested me both orally and in writing that conversations
                    regarding a trade agreement be resumed. Please instruct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
